WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.500
- Well, we're a week from Halloween.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.333
Do you decorate?

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:03.220
Do you get into it?

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.470
- I personally don't decorate,

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:08.710
but I think it's basically
like my family's religion.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:11.930
So it, the house is,
(audience laughs)

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.840
Linda, who I share my youngest
child with, goes crazy.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.090
And we have this sort of, like, walkway

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.110
in the front of my house.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:19.943
And so she--

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:21.820
- [Kelly] Oh my God, the person
had an arrow in their head.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.110
- [Guest] Yeah, decorates,
you know, it's intense.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.310
And everybody thinks I'm
sort of, like, the buzzkill

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.570
of the situation,

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.540
but I do enjoy it.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.600
- [Kelly] You might need the opposite,

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.470
the yang note to this.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:34.800
That's a lot, that I just saw.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.070
- No, It's a lot.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.750
And actually when little kids come up,

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.740
I get nervous because some

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.070
of them love it.
- They cry?

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.820
- And some kids cry,

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.440
which I think is terrible,
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.700
but depending on who you ask
in my family, it's like--

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:49.533
- [Kelly] They think they've won.

00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:51.061
- It's a victory for them.

00:00:51.061 --> 00:00:52.370
It's a victory for them.
- We scared them.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.560
We get to keep the candy.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.380
- Yeah, I'm like, don't
bring your kid in here.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.300
- Oh my God, I love,

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.700
my son just really got into it.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:00:59.533
But it was kind of freaky,

00:00:59.533 --> 00:01:03.900
because he's five and he's like
the more death, the better,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.260
like, and I'm just like, wait, what?

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.410
And like, it's kind of crazy.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.930
But yeah, everything scares me and my,

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.780
I'm you, I love decorating,
but I don't like scary stuff,

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.594
- Right, I don't--
- But my front yard,

00:01:13.594 --> 00:01:15.660
the drive, everything looks scary as hell.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.450
But anyway, what we do for our children.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:19.700
Did you have a favorite costume,

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.533
though, when you were a kid?

00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:21.880
Did you like dressing
up when you were a kid?

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.160
- I dressed up as Billy Idol.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.650
That was, like, my favorite.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.880
- [Kelly] I love, nice day for a,

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:32.080
oh my gosh!
(audience applauds)

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.195
That's amazing, please,

00:01:33.195 --> 00:01:34.870
tell me you're singing "White Wedding."

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.070
I say for, just the whole, like--

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.950
- Well, I can't sing at all, sadly,

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.140
but I, then the crazy thing was,

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:43.357
my sister, I think this is public,

00:01:43.357 --> 00:01:45.570
I hope, I'm sure it is, sorry!

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:46.403
- [Kelly] Wait, what?

00:01:46.403 --> 00:01:48.059
- She ended up dating Billy Idol.

00:01:48.059 --> 00:01:50.580
- Billy Idol?
- For like a minute.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.540
- Your family is different
from mine, like, wow!

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.373
- No, it was crazy.

00:01:54.373 --> 00:01:55.206
And then she was like,

00:01:55.206 --> 00:01:56.570
"Do you want to talk to him on the phone?"

00:01:56.570 --> 00:01:57.403
And I was like--
- What?

00:01:57.403 --> 00:01:59.810
- This is crazy, yeah.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.390
- Did you just cry?

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.223
'Cause you were so young.

00:02:02.223 --> 00:02:03.160
I would have been freaking out.

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:04.165
- I was freaking out.

00:02:04.165 --> 00:02:04.998
I was freaking out.

00:02:04.998 --> 00:02:05.910
It was pretty amazing.

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.610
- Okay, 'cause mine
was, like, Steven Tyler.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:08.760
If somebody was like,
"You want to just talk

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:09.593
to Steven Tyler on the phone?"

00:02:09.593 --> 00:02:11.010
I'd be like, "What?"

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.543
I mean, yeah, "Yakka-kakka-kow!"

00:02:12.543 --> 00:02:13.751
I would've just answered
it like that. (laughs)

00:02:13.751 --> 00:02:14.977
(audience laughs)

00:02:14.977 --> 00:02:18.553
I was a big fan, I still am.
- It was pretty crazy.

